			"id":"23a0167bba8aee63",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There is a note saying that [[Christoph]] has taken the car without permission.\n\nIf you have use the [[031 - Utility Closet]] to turn the power on the Garage on, you can open the Garage Door, unlocking a path to the [[West Path]] and also unlocking the [[Outer Room]] permanent upgrade.\n\nCan use Car Keys item to unlock the Car to find another letter with additional lore.\nThe car keys can also be used to open the trunk, where you can find a few rare items for the current run.\n\nThere is an upgrade disk (only once) on the locked box at the trunk on the back of the car.",
